This product includes software developed by third parties. Dependencies are
declared in requirements.txt and are not vendored in this repository.

Architectural ideas and training recipes were informed by the published work
listed in the README, including FlashSAC (Kim et al., ICLR 2026), AE-PPO
(MDPI 2026), LibMoE (arXiv 2411.00918), NanoChat-MoE (Duan et al., 2026),
Tiny-MoE (Ebied, 2026), GQA (Ainslie et al., 2023), CleanRL (Huang et al.),
ERL (Shi et al., 2026) and LSE (Chen et al., 2026).

The training corpora, model checkpoints and cached artefacts used during
development are NOT included in this repository.
